## Introduction

Imagine a bank combining the world of traditional finance and the fast-growing world of modern digital cryptocurrencies, all in the palm of your hand, on your phone screen. We are building a new reality of digital finance.

Zima Bank is a medium between TradFi and DeFi, SEPA-connected. Certified by EUPL in accordance with FATCA, compliant with FINTRAC. 50M+ monthly turnover, 150M assets under management.

Driven by Blockchain-oriented mindset, we are happy to deliver our services for both corporates and individuals.

## Value Proposition

**Our services include:**

-   Corporate and individual IBANs;

-   Payment processing and bank acquiring;

-   OTC deals structuring - on-off-ramp;

-   SEPA & SWIFT, multi-currency transfer options;

-   Virtual and physical Debit Cards for individuals;

-   Automatisation of cryptocurrency and traditional financial transactions;

-   Banking services within Telegram App.

**Uniqueness Factor**

Zima Bank is the world's first Telegram banking application. Having user friendly interface, it includes сrypto-fiat exchange supporting USDT and TON for convenient in-app conversion, as well as staking program.

Operating previously only via Web version of Zima Bank, in August we officially launched Beta version of our Telegram application and yet achieved great results, having more than 70K+ monthly users.

